1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,935
Suku Maya ternyata meracuni
air mereka sendiri...

2
00:00:02,935 --> 00:00:04,892
gara-gara warna kesayangan mereka!

3
00:00:04,892 --> 00:00:05,644
Kuil,

4
00:00:05,644 --> 00:00:06,510
patung,

5
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:09,906
bahkan jenazah dilumuri merah
menyala dari batu sinabar.

6
00:00:09,906 --> 00:00:11,025
Masalahnya,

7
00:00:11,025 --> 00:00:13,264
sinabar adalah bijih merkuri.

8
00:00:13,264 --> 00:00:16,754
Hujan menyapunya ke danau dan cenote.

9
00:00:16,754 --> 00:00:18,598
Lumpur danau yang baru diteliti:

10
00:00:18,598 --> 00:00:21,505
merkurinya melonjak lebih
dari 100 kali lipat!

11
00:00:21,505 --> 00:00:22,860
Di satu cenote,

12
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,597
racun itu bertahan hampir 300 tahun...

13
00:00:25,597 --> 00:00:27,234
sampai kejayaan Maya runtuh.

14
00:00:27,234 --> 00:00:27,733
Follow,

15
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,964
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
